# A gatekeeper of the fire dragon (31687, GrandBossTeleporter) opens its own door (24210005) and none of the
# other two, answering no page (onTalk, DoorData.openMe). Expectations are derived from the
# reference source; the reference probe reads no door line.
character Pilgrim 60
script script.teleport.GrandBossTeleporter
page default/31687.htm
page script/teleport/GrandBossTeleporter/
npc keeper 31687 Folk 10 0 0
door door_a 24210004 100 0 0
door door_b 24210005 120 0 0
door door_c 24210006 140 0 0

action keeper
action keeper
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=keeper item=0 page=default/31687.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{keeper}_Quest GrandBossTeleporter
  S ActionFailed
  open door_a no
  open door_b yes
  open door_c no
